{"asset_key":"ep6/quest_story_16212140","episode":"ep6","category":"quest_story","story_id":"16212140","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1621214001:0":{"text":"这么快就配好了……而且这比例——近乎完美。","source_cn":"这么快就配好了……而且这比例——近乎完美。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1C99673538EEC0CF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1621214002:0":{"text":"就算是经验老到的药师，也未必能在这么短的时间内做到这一步。","source_cn":"就算是经验老到的药师，也未必能在这么短的时间内做到这一步。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x02E0599936C8A9B5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1621214003:0":{"text":"果然，莱希拉姆的精英们，不管做什么都不含糊。","source_cn":"果然，莱希拉姆的精英们，不管做什么都不含糊。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4A6D8A7E2C7D5FD1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1621214004:1":{"text":"好了，小家伙，来一点这个……味道不算好，但会让你轻松些。","source_cn":"好了，小家伙，来一点这个……味道不算好，但会让你轻松些。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6757CD587932E68E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1621214005:1":{"text":"哈梅尔小心地将药缓缓喂给松鼠。","source_cn":"哈梅尔小心地将药缓缓喂给松鼠。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFFAB74C3C4A129E1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_